d  this meeting what's clearly happening is  that Kim jong-un is engaging in a  diplomatic flurry of meetings to make  sure that he knows what everyone is  doing and that he's shored up his  relationship with China  now is Xi Jingping who invited Kim  jong-eun here which could be a sign that  China really wanted to make sure that  these two countries are on the same page  now interestingly enough President Trump  tweeted this morning that Xi Jingping  sent him a message saying that Kim Jong  moon is looking forward to meeting him  Anthony Ben Tracy and Beijing thanks
 

